 "utterances": [
  {
   "start": 2.2,
   "end": 5.7,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Morning, everyone. Are we all on? Right, let's get going."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.45,
   "end": 13.8,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Morning. Still no joy with the broken coffee machine in the canteen. That's not a maintenance request, that's just me whinging."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.74,
   "end": 17.84,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "You sound remarkably cheerful without it."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.69,
   "end": 21.14,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Emergency flask, mate. I'm not an amateur."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.09,
   "end": 26.24,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Some of us have just got tea. Radical approach."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.75,
   "end": 30.6,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Can you hear me? I've got the headset doing something odd."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.05,
   "end": 33.45,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yeah, you're clear now."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.69,
   "end": 40.64,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Lovely. It was coming out of the laptop as well. Hearing you twice was a bit much."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.13,
   "end": 44.28,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Once is plenty. Hannah, how did you get on?"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.59,
   "end": 47.39,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Yeah, the near-miss write-up's finished. Boxed that off."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.29,
   "end": 49.49,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Brilliant, cheers."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.74,
   "end": 59.84,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Mide asked me to pass on that he's handing over organising the toolbox talk for the team. Sarah Okafor, can you take that over from him?"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.11,
   "end": 63.91,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll take over organising the toolbox talk."
  },
  {
   "start": 66.02,
   "end": 67.22,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Thanks. Jamie?"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.72,
   "end": 75.77,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "I've made a start on the Kestrel collection, the replacement parts for the feed pump. A bit more to do on that yet."
  },
  {
   "start": 76.82,
   "end": 78.02,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Okay, cheers."
  },
  {
   "start": 79.99,
   "end": 85.94,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "And my lock-out tag-out sign-off on the little water valve on two has moved to next week."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.47,
   "end": 88.67,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Right, understood."
  },
  {
   "start": 89.71,
   "end": 97.76,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "I'm about halfway through clearing the jam and checking the sensors on the arm on two. Been a bit fiddly getting through it."
  },
  {
   "start": 99.23,
   "end": 101.68,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Yeah, not much elbow room round there."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.5,
   "end": 105.3,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "No. Especially with these sleeves catching on everything."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.98,
   "end": 110.53,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "My monthly fire alarm test is all done, by the way. All fine."
  },
  {
   "start": 111.92,
   "end": 113.12,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Good stuff."
  },
  {
   "start": 115.11,
   "end": 120.71,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "And I signed off the inspection on the alarm box on Tuesday. That's already squared away."
  },
  {
   "start": 122.28,
   "end": 125.78,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Right, new bits. Marcus, you were about to come in?"
  },
  {
   "start": 127.53,
   "end": 131.38,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll schedule downtime for the hot bearing with production today."
  },
  {
   "start": 133.07,
   "end": 137.27,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Fine, whenever you get a chance. Doesn't need to jump the queue."
  },
  {
   "start": 138.78,
   "end": 141.58,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Yeah, no problem. Just arranging the window, then."
  },
  {
   "start": 142.67,
   "end": 144.42,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Cheers, Marcus Hale. Appreciate it."
  },
  {
   "start": 146.47,
   "end": 150.32,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "On the dryer, are we talking calibration rather than changing sensors?"
  },
  {
   "start": 150.83,
   "end": 153.98,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yeah, calibration. I'll recalibrate the sensors on the dryer."
  },
  {
   "start": 154.39,
   "end": 157.19,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Okay, Reidy. That's what I was getting at—"
  },
  {
   "start": 158.96,
   "end": 161.06,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Sorry, go on. Thought you'd finished."
  },
  {
   "start": 162.28,
   "end": 165.78,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "No, I had. Teams has that little lag, hasn't it."
  },
  {
   "start": 166.37,
   "end": 171.27,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "And what about picking up the replacement parts for the palletizer from Harbour Road?"
  },
  {
   "start": 172.54,
   "end": 178.49,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "I'll go to Harbour Road to pick up the replacement parts for the palletizer on the 3rd."
  },
  {
   "start": 179.28,
   "end": 181.38,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Right, on the 3rd. Got you."
  },
  {
   "start": 182.9,
   "end": 184.1,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yep."
  },
  {
   "start": 185.77,
   "end": 187.87,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Okay, Reidy, you've got the collection."
  },
  {
   "start": 190.19,
   "end": 192.99,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yep. Other one is line 1 mould temp."
  },
  {
   "start": 194.91,
   "end": 196.11,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "A function test?"
  },
  {
   "start": 197.83,
   "end": 202.03,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll run a function test on the line 1 mould temp."
  },
  {
   "start": 203.68,
   "end": 205.43,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Right, Reidy. Happy with that."
  },
  {
   "start": 206.88,
   "end": 208.63,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Sorry, was that line 1?"
  },
  {
   "start": 210.24,
   "end": 211.44,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Line 1, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 213.02,
   "end": 216.17,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Got you. Radio went off right in my ear."
  },
  {
   "start": 217.92,
   "end": 221.07,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "It's either the radio or Teams. Never both behaving."
  },
  {
   "start": 223.22,
   "end": 224.97,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Usually both talking at once."
  },
  {
   "start": 227.31,
   "end": 229.06,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Anything else for this morning?"
  },
  {
   "start": 229.58,
   "end": 230.98,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Nothing else from me."
  },
  {
   "start": 231.33,
   "end": 233.08,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "No, that's me as well."
  },
  {
   "start": 234.16,
   "end": 238.01,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "All good. Apart from the coffee situation, but I'll spare you."
  },
  {
   "start": 239.08,
   "end": 241.88,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Much appreciated. Right, thanks everyone, leave it there."
  },
  {
   "start": 244.1,
   "end": 245.3,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Cheers, all."
  },
  {
   "start": 245.71,
   "end": 246.91,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Cheers."
  }
 ],
